== Icelandic ==
{{Icelandic declension kvk vb 01a ö|fjallg|ng}}
===Etymology===
From ''[[fjall]]'' "[[mountain]]" + ''[[ganga]]'' meaning "[[walk]]" or "[[hike]]". Literally meaning "mountain walk" or "mountain hike".
